Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1140
Set Height 680
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Framerate 15
Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '; clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
Type "concatguard examples/valid.ffconcat"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "concatguard examples/broken.ffconcat"
Enter
Sleep 8s
